# Dr.Egeria runtime byproducts written next to the command documents when
# `dr_egeria --process` runs from docs/dr-egeria/ — processed-copy archives,
# per-run logs. Outputs of executing the docs, not source content.
docs/dr-egeria/egeria-outbox/
docs/dr-egeria/**/egeria-outbox/
docs/dr-egeria/**/logs/
docs/dr-egeria/logs/
docs/dr-egeria/debug_log.log
# Probe outputs from running dr_egeria with the package root as cwd.
/egeria-outbox/
.prefect-run/
